  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint NCA/SC FGM-CEFM Programme Phase IV - NCA Puntland</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Norwegian Church Aid (NCA) / Save the Children International (SCI) Female Genital Mutilation (FGM) and Child Early and Forced Marriage (CEFM) Programme &#x2013; Phase IV will be implemented by NCA in Garowe, Eyl and Dongorayo districts in Puntland State, Somalia. The project supports the abandonment of FGM and CEFM through community-led prevention and social norm change activities, engagement of key influencers (including religious and community leaders, parents and youth), and strengthened referral pathways to protection and support services for girls and women at risk or affected. It also promotes accountability and coordination with relevant local institutions to improve prevention and response mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
